I propose a massive Voip/IRC party for Lojbanists everywhere. Let's
all meet on Teamspeak, Skype, and our IRC channel in the last three
weeks of September, to speak in Lojban, talk in English about our
plans for Lojban projects, and maybe even record ourselves for a
podcast. Please visit the following web page to fill in your own
availability:

http://www.meetomatic.com/respond.php?id=KDMAF3

This weekend I'll announce the day with the most available attendance.

-Eppcott


